<html><head><title>Photosynthesis</title></head><body><h1>Photosynthesis</h1><p>Photosynthesis is the process by which green plants and algae convert light energy into chemical energy stored in glucose.</p><figure><img src='../I/chloroplast_diagram.png' alt='Chloroplast diagram' width='300' height='200'/><figcaption>Structure of a chloroplast</figcaption></figure><p>Chlorophyll absorbs mostly blue and red light and reflects green light, which is why leaves look green.</p></body></html>